# Cross-origin isolation, so onnxruntime's WebAssembly build can use more than one
# core. Without these, SharedArrayBuffer is unavailable and depth estimation runs
# single-threaded. Safe here because every asset is same-origin.
#
# This file is the Cloudflare Pages / Netlify format. Other hosts need their own.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
